scale: ~305 lines across 7 files [L]

- `crates/vox-compiler/src/parser/descent/expr/pratt_match.rs`: Implement parsing for `Ident(kwargs) { children }` syntax. If an `Ident(args)` expression is followed by a `{` (after optional newlines), it is parsed as an `Expr::Jsx` element. This is only applicable when the callee is a bare identifier, not a method chain or field access. Positional arguments are rejected, enforcing keyword-only arguments for view calls.
- `crates/vox-compiler/src/parser/descent/tests.rs`: Add two new parser tests. `test_parse_view_call_form_lowers_to_jsx` verifies that the new view-call syntax correctly sugars into an `Expr::Jsx` AST node. `test_view_call_positional_arg_rejected` confirms that positional arguments in view calls result in a parse error.
